(154, 'Hi Team,\r\n\r\nAs you may have seen on the news, Pampanga is currently under Signal No. 4 due to Super Typhoon Uwan. We understand this may be a challenging time for many, and we want to remind everyone that your safety and well-being are our top priority.\r\n\r\nPlease stay in close communication with your client or Team Lead regarding your work arrangements and any challenges you might be facing due to the weather.\r\n\r\nFor those who will be reporting to work, please take extra care when traveling and ensure you’re updated on local advisories. You may reach out through the following emergency contacts if needed:\r\n\r\nBerthaphil Emergency Contact: \r\n\r\n - Berthaphil 24/7 Guard - 0922-576-0806\r\n - Berthaphil CSR – 0917-525-2390\r\n\r\nHR Hotline (available 24/7): \r\n\r\nHR: \r\n- 0919 099 3036\r\n- 0917 389 7962\r\n- 0998 297 1494\r\n- 0915 056 1780\r\n\r\nIT & Facilities:\r\n\r\n- 0993 864 2974\r\n- 0929 274 1102\r\n\r\nPampanga Emergency Hotline (please find below image)\r\n\r\nLet’s all stay alert and look out for one another during the storm. Please don’t hesitate to reach out if you need any assistance.\r\n\r\nTake care and stay safe, everyone.\r\n\r\nWarm regards,\r\nHR Department', 'Important Advisory: Super Typhoon Uwan – Safety Reminder and Emergency Contacts', 'Admin', '2025-11-09 12:27:20', '[{\"original\":\"shared image.jpg\",\"stored\":\"uploads\\/file_691018287b2db4.24327653.jpg\"}]', 1),
(155, 'Hi Team,\r\n\r\nAs you may have seen on the news, Pampanga is currently under Signal No. 4 due to Super Typhoon Uwan. We understand this may be a challenging time for many, and we want to remind everyone that your safety and well-being are our top priority.\r\n\r\nPlease stay in close communication with your client or Team Lead regarding your work arrangements and any challenges you might be facing due to the weather.\r\n\r\nFor those who will be reporting to work, please take extra care when traveling and ensure you’re updated on local advisories. You may reach out through the following emergency contacts if needed:\r\n\r\nBerthaphil Emergency Contact:\r\n\r\n- Berthaphil 24/7 Guard - 0922-576-0806\r\n- Berthaphil CSR – 0917-525-2390\r\n\r\nHR Hotline (available 24/7):\r\n\r\nHR:\r\n- 0919 099 3036\r\n- 0917 389 7962\r\n- 0998 297 1494\r\n- 0915 056 1780\r\n\r\nIT & Facilities:\r\n\r\n- 0993 864 2974\r\n- 0929 274 1102\r\n\r\nPampanga Emergency Hotline (please find below image)\r\n\r\nLet’s all stay alert and look out for one another during the storm. Please don’t hesitate to reach out if you need any assistance.\r\n\r\nTake care and stay safe, everyone.\r\n\r\nWarm regards,\r\nHR Department', 'Important Advisory: Super Typhoon Uwan – Safety Reminder and Emergency Contacts', 'Admin', '2025-11-09 12:30:40', '[{\"original\":\"shared image.jpg\",\"stored\":\"uploads\\/file_691018f026f5f0.59654814.jpg\"}]', 0),
