(159, 'Hi Team,\r\n\r\nHappy Tuesday!\r\n\r\nYou’re invited to our Engagement Thursday happening on November 20, 2025 (Thursday) at the pantry area from 12:00 NN to 1:00 PM!\r\n\r\nCome and enjoy good food, great vibes, and fun conversations as we share all the exciting activities lined up for December! \r\n\r\nLet’s take a quick break, connect, and celebrate together.\r\n\r\nSee you there — and bring your energy and appetite! 🎉🍽️✨\r\n\r\nCheers,\r\nHR Department', 'Engagement Thursday (November 20, 2025)', 'Admin', '2025-11-18 08:29:21', NULL, 0),
(160, 'Show off your rhythm, creativity, and holiday spirit with a dance performance that captures the magic of Christmas! 💃✨🕺\r\n\r\nSubmit a dance clip no longer than 3 minutes.\r\n\r\n🏅 Judging Criteria (100%)\r\nTotal number of ❤️ heart reactions on the official Facebook post. Only counted if the reactor follows ResourceStaff’s official Facebook page. Participants must also comment and tag three friends on the post.\r\n________________________________________\r\n📋 Guidelines\r\n• All participating groups must register through the provided link: https://forms.office.com/r/cYvSsxsyKk\r\n• Registration deadline: November 25, 2025.\r\n• Record and submit a Christmas-themed dance performance (max 3 minutes).\r\n• Deadline for video submission: December 7, 2025.\r\n• All entries will be posted on Facebook on December 8, 2025.\r\n• Voting ends: December 11, 2025 at 3 PM.\r\n• Winners will be announced at YEP on December 12, 2025.\r\n• Facebook reactions will determine the winners based on the judging criteria.', '🎄 Christmas Dance Showdown 2025 🎄', 'Admin', '2025-11-25 13:10:26', NULL, 0),
(161, 'Show off your rhythm, creativity, and holiday spirit with a dance performance that captures the magic of Christmas! 💃✨🕺\r\n\r\nSubmit a dance clip no longer than 3 minutes.\r\n\r\n🏅 Judging Criteria (100%)\r\nTotal number of ❤️ heart reactions on the official Facebook post. Only counted if the reactor follows ResourceStaff’s official Facebook page. Participants must also comment and tag three friends on the post.\r\n________________________________________\r\n📋 Guidelines\r\n• All participating groups must register through the provided link: https://forms.office.com/r/cYvSsxsyKk\r\n• Registration deadline: November 25, 2025.\r\n• Record and submit a Christmas-themed dance performance (max 3 minutes).\r\n• Deadline for video submission: December 7, 2025.\r\n• All entries will be posted on Facebook on December 8, 2025.\r\n• Voting ends: December 11, 2025 at 3 PM.\r\n• Winners will be announced at YEP on December 12, 2025.\r\n• Facebook reactions will determine the winners based on the judging criteria.', '🎄 Christmas Dance Showdown 2025 🎄', 'Admin', '2025-11-25 13:10:27', NULL, 0),
(162, 'Hi, everyone!\r\n\r\nWe hope the Christmas Dance Showdown announcement has sparked some excitement for our upcoming Year-End Party and to make things even more thrilling… we’re happy to reveal the prizes!\r\n\r\n(1/3)', '🎄 Christmas Dance Showdown 2025 🎄', 'Admin', '2025-11-26 15:15:09', '[{\"original\":\"4.png\",\"stored\":\"uploads\\/file_6926a8fd764b07.95329963.png\"}]', 0),
