(189, 'We’re excited to announce that HDesk is launching soon as RSS’s official ticketing system, a smarter, faster, and more efficient way to address your concerns and inquiries.\r\n\r\nGet ready for a smoother support experience and stay tuned for more updates. In the meantime, don’t miss our teaser video and see what’s coming next!', 'Ticketing System on the Way! 🎉', 'Admin', '2026-02-22 16:01:50', '[{\"original\":\"Hdesk_revise.mp4\",\"stored\":\"uploads\\/file_699ab7ede941b4.87825833.mp4\"}]', 0),
(190, 'Hi All,\r\n\r\nPlease revisit your attendance history for this payroll. Kindly note that any late filing of OTs, time adjustments, and leaves will be credited next cutoff. Submit any disputes for this payroll until 2PM today, March 02, 2026.', 'Payroll Feb 16 - 28, 2026', 'Admin', '2026-03-02 09:23:02', NULL, 0),
(191, 'Hi All,\r\n\r\nMSN. :))\r\n\r\nCheers,\r\nHR Department', 'Payroll Feb 16 - 28, 2026', 'Admin', '2026-03-05 12:21:12', NULL, 0),
(192, 'Hi Team,\r\n\r\nHappy Friday!\r\n\r\nStarting February 1, all LOA requests to our HMO must be submitted through their Virtual App.\r\n\r\nPlease refer to the video below for the step-by-step tutorial on how to create a Virtual App account and how to submit your LOA request.\r\n\r\nIf you have any questions or need assistance, feel free to reach out.\r\n\r\nThank you!', 'Announcement: New Process for LOA Requests via Virtual App', 'Admin', '2026-03-13 15:13:53', '[{\"original\":\"Cocolife Virtual App Registration Video.mp4\",\"stored\":\"uploads\\/file_69b3b9316ee214.99145441.mp4\"}]', 0),
(193, 'Hi All!\r\n\r\nOur most awaited Ticketing System is finally here! 🎉\r\n\r\nTo help you get started with HDesk and make the most out of its features, please watch our quick video tutorial.\r\nThis will guide you on how to properly submit and track your requests through the ticketing system.', 'Getting Started with HDesk: Your New Ticketing System', 'Admin', '2026-03-13 16:17:14', '[{\"original\":\"hdesk_guide.mp4\",\"stored\":\"uploads\\/file_69b3c80a6488a3.43801915.mp4\"}]', 0),
(194, 'Hi All,\r\n\r\nPlease revisit your attendance history for this payroll. Kindly note that any late filing of OTs, time adjustments, and leaves will be credited next cutoff. Submit any disputes for this payroll until 2PM today, March 16, 2026.', 'Payroll Feb 01 - 15, 2026', 'Admin', '2026-03-16 08:14:00', NULL, 1),
(195, 'Hi All,\r\n\r\nPlease revisit your attendance history for this payroll. Kindly note that any late filing of OTs, time adjustments, and leaves will be credited next cutoff. Submit any disputes for this payroll until 2PM today, March 16, 2026.', 'Payroll March 01 - 15, 2026', 'Admin', '2026-03-16 08:14:25', NULL, 0),
(196, 'Hi Team,\r\n\r\nHappy Monday!\r\n\r\nOn March 12, 2026, the Office of the President announced that March 20, 2026 (Friday) will be observed as a public holiday.\r\n\r\nUpon checking our holiday swapping calendar, only the following states will observe this holiday as it is listed as an unmatched holiday: VIC, NSW, and QLD.\r\n\r\nAn advisory has already been sent to your respective clients. Please note that if you will be working on Friday, we will require approval from your client. If your client allows you to take the holiday off, there is no need to inform HR.\r\n\r\nFor the remaining states (WA and SA), March 20 will be treated as a normal working day since this date has been matched with the April 6, 2026 holiday in the holiday swapping calendar.\r\n\r\nThank you!\r\n\r\nCheers,\r\nHR', 'HR Advisory: Public Holiday - March 20, 2026 (Friday)', 'Admin', '2026-03-16 09:21:28', '[{\"original\":\"Holiday Proclamation.pdf\",\"stored\":\"uploads\\/file_69b75b1823dee8.64923663.pdf\"}]', 0),
(197, 'Hi Team,\r\n\r\nThis is to inform everyone that we will be conducting our annual fire and earthquake drill on Tuesday, March 24, 2026, from 2:00 PM to 3:00 PM (PH Time). A notification has already been sent to our clients.\r\n\r\nPlease note that only onsite and hybrid team members are required to attend the drill. Team members working remotely or at Aeropark do not need to come to the office.\r\n\r\nThank you for your cooperation.\r\n\r\nRegards,\r\nHR Department', 'Annual Fire & Earthquake Drill - March 24, 2026 (Tuesday)', 'Admin', '2026-03-20 09:44:40', NULL, 0),
(198, 'Hi Everyone,\r\n\r\nDue to the holidays this April and the limited banking days, our cutoff for the April 5 payout will be earlier than usual.\r\n\r\nAll OTs, leaves, schedule changes, and time adjustments must be filed by March 31, 2026, at 1:00 PM. Any submissions after this deadline will be processed in the next payout.\r\n\r\nPlease ensure strict compliance.\r\n\r\nThank you!', 'HR Advisory: Payroll Cut-off for April 5, 2026 Payout', 'Admin', '2026-03-25 07:23:59', NULL, 0),
(199, 'Hi Team,\r\n\r\nWe’re happy to announce that Executive Optical will be visiting our office this Thursday for an engagement activity.\r\n\r\nThey will be offering free eye check-ups and will also bring a selection of frames and contact lenses for those who wish to avail of their products. As part of our renewed partnership with EO, purchases made during the event will be discounted and can be paid via salary deduction in four staggered payments.\r\n\r\nThe program will start at 11:00 AM with a wellness talk, followed by the eye check-ups and product availability for interested employees. Food and drinks will also be provided.\r\n\r\nThank you, and we hope to see you there!\r\n\r\nCheers,\r\nHR Department', 'Engagement Thursday', 'Admin', '2026-03-25 11:56:10', NULL, 0),
(200, 'Wishing a big happy birthday to RJ, our HR & Talent Specialist!\r\n\r\nThank you for all the work you put into supporting the team, from recruitment to keeping things running smoothly behind the scenes. We know a lot of what you do doesn’t always get seen, but it definitely makes a big difference.\r\n\r\nAppreciate your consistency, reliability, and the way you support both the team and our clients.\r\n\r\nHope you have a great birthday today and get to enjoy it (with good food, of course 😄). Cheers to another year ahead! 🎂✨', '🎉 Happy Birthday, RJ! 🎉', 'Admin', '2026-04-01 07:50:14', '[{\"original\":\"White and Pink Happy Birthday Facebook Post.png\",\"stored\":\"uploads\\/file_69cc5db6645e84.43235024.png\"}]', 0),
(201, 'Hi All,\r\n\r\nPlease submit your payroll disputes on or before 12:00 noon today. Any disputes filed after 12:00 noon will still be recorded but will be credited in the next payroll cycle.\r\n\r\nThank you.', 'HR Advisory: Payroll Cut-off for April 5, 2026 Payout', 'Admin', '2026-04-01 10:48:50', NULL, 0),
(202, 'Hi Team,\r\n\r\nThis is to officially announce that our Annual APE will take place on April 14, 2026 (Tuesday) at the RSS Office from 9:00 AM to 3:00 PM.\r\n\r\nFor team members at OCC and those working remotely, we will be reaching out to provide a list of HMO-accredited diagnostic centers. Please select your preferred diagnostic center from the list so we can arrange your APE accordingly.\r\n\r\nFor team members who have recently transitioned to a remote setup, please note that you are included in the onsite schedule and are required to report to the office on April 14. Stool sample cups will be distributed this week, we will announce once they are available.\r\n\r\nFor your strict compliance. Thank you!\r\n\r\nCheers,\r\nHR Department', 'ANNUAL APE: April 14, 2026', 'Admin', '2026-04-07 13:23:21', NULL, 0),
(203, 'Hi Team,\r\n\r\nHappy to announce that our Engagement Thursday is happening tomorrow, April 9, 2026 (Thursday), in celebration of Easter! 🐰🥚\r\n\r\nExciting details will be announced shortly, watch out! 👀✨\r\n\r\nCheers,\r\nHR Department', 'Engagement Thursday: April 9, 2026', 'Admin', '2026-04-08 10:03:57', NULL, 0),
(204, 'Hi Team! 🐣🥚\r\n\r\nOur first event for today starts NOW! We’ve hidden eggs around the office, and each one comes with exciting prizes 🎉\r\n\r\nHere’s how it works:\r\nJust find an egg and bring it to the HR team to claim your prize (if there’s one inside 😉).\r\n\r\n✨ Keep an eye out, there are 2 special Golden Eggs hidden somewhere!\r\n\r\n⏰ You have until 3:00 PM today to hunt for eggs.\r\n\r\nHappy hunting and good luck, everyone! 🐰🥚', 'Engagement Thursday: Egg Hunt!', 'Admin', '2026-04-09 11:28:40', NULL, 0),
(205, 'Hi Everyone,\r\n\r\nHappy Monday!\r\n\r\nJust a reminder that our Annual Physical Examination will be happening tomorrow, from 9:00 AM to 2:00 PM (PH time).\r\n\r\nPlease bring your HMO card and company ID or any government-issued ID. For those who don’t have their HMO card yet, the HMO ID number we provided via email will suffice. Please see attached APE flow chart and instructions for your reference.\r\n\r\nImportant note: Only pregnant employees or those who were hired from December 2025 to March 2026 are allowed to waive their X-ray.\r\n\r\nThank you!\r\n\r\nCheers,\r\nHR Department', 'APE: April 14, 2026', 'Admin', '2026-04-13 10:36:18', '[{\"original\":\"APE PROCESS FLOW CHART.pdf\",\"stored\":\"uploads\\/file_69dc56a2276f63.24796754.pdf\"}]', 1),
(206, 'Hi Everyone,\r\n\r\nHappy Monday!\r\n\r\nJust a reminder that our Annual Physical Examination will be happening tomorrow, from 9:00 AM to 2:00 PM (PH time).\r\n\r\nPlease bring your HMO card and company ID or any government-issued ID. For those who don’t have their HMO card yet, the HMO ID number we provided via email will suffice. Please see attached APE flow chart and instructions for your reference.\r\n\r\nImportant note: Only pregnant employees or those who were hired from December 2025 to March 2026 are allowed to waive their X-ray.\r\n\r\nThank you!\r\n\r\nCheers,\r\nHR Department', 'APE: April 14, 2026', 'Admin', '2026-04-13 10:36:25', '[{\"original\":\"APE PROCESS FLOW CHART.pdf\",\"stored\":\"uploads\\/file_69dc56a90fcaf2.96027748.pdf\"}]', 1),
(207, 'Hi Everyone,\r\n\r\nHappy Monday!\r\n\r\nJust a reminder that our Annual Physical Examination will be happening tomorrow, from 9:00 AM to 2:00 PM (PH time).\r\n\r\nPlease bring your HMO card and company ID or any government-issued ID. For those who don’t have their HMO card yet, the HMO ID number we provided via email will suffice. Please see attached APE flow chart and instructions for your reference.\r\n\r\nImportant note: Only pregnant employees or those who were hired from December 2025 to March 2026 are allowed to waive their X-ray.\r\n\r\nThank you!\r\n\r\nCheers,\r\nHR Department', 'APE: April 14, 2026', 'Admin', '2026-04-13 10:36:57', '[{\"original\":\"APE PROCESS FLOW CHART.pdf\",\"stored\":\"uploads\\/file_69dc56c99932b9.84440280.pdf\"}]', 0),
(208, 'Hi All,\r\n\r\nPlease submit your payroll disputes on or before 12:00 noon tomorrow, April 16, 2026.. Any disputes filed after 12:00 noon will still be recorded but will be credited in the next payroll cycle.\r\n\r\nThank you.', 'HR Advisory: Payroll Cut-off for April 20, 2026 Payout', 'Admin', '2026-04-15 15:41:51', NULL, 0),
(209, 'Hi All,\r\n\r\nMSN. :))', 'HR Advisory: Payroll for April 20, 2026', 'Admin', '2026-04-20 13:41:32', NULL, 0),
(210, 'Please be informed that the next payroll scheduled for May 05, 2026 will be time-limited, as our payroll processor will be on leave from May 1 to May 5, 2026.\r\n\r\nIn this regard, all employees are kindly advised to file and submit leave requests on or before 12:00 noon of April 30, 2026 to ensure they are properly processed and reflected in the upcoming payroll.\r\n\r\nRequests submitted beyond this deadline may not be accommodated in time for the May 05 payroll cycle.\r\n\r\nThank you for your cooperation.', 'HR Advisory: Upcoming Payroll Processing Schedule', 'Admin', '2026-04-21 12:00:46', NULL, 0),
(211, 'Hi everyone,\r\n\r\nFor those who ordered eyeglasses or other products from EO, your items are now ready for claiming. Please arrange to pick them up at your convenience.\r\n\r\nThank you!', 'EO Purchases are now ready for claiming!', 'Admin', '2026-04-21 13:47:51', NULL, 0),
(212, 'Wishing a wonderful birthday to Peach, the bunso of the team!\r\n\r\nThank you for your continued support and your readiness to help everyone, no matter the task. Your willingness to step in and assist plays an important role in keeping things running smoothly.\r\n\r\nWe truly appreciate your reliability, positive attitude, and the support you provide to the team in our day-to-day work.\r\n\r\nWe hope you have a great birthday and get to enjoy your day (with good food, of course 😊). Cheers to another year ahead! 🎂✨', '🎉 Happy Birthday, Peach! 🎉', 'Admin', '2026-04-22 10:18:53', '[{\"original\":\"Blue Modern Happy Birthday Flyer.jpg\",\"stored\":\"uploads\\/file_69e8300d954129.16646767.jpg\"}]', 0),
(213, 'Hi Team,\r\n\r\nI hope everyone is doing well.\r\n\r\nWe’re reaching out to knock on your hearts for one of our team members, Nina. Her baby boy, Alexander Julian Cruz, was born prematurely at 26 weeks and has been bravely fighting in the NICU. We’re happy to share that he has made great progress and is now able to breathe on his own. He is expected to be discharged this week, a big milestone for their family.\r\n\r\nHowever, due to his extended hospital stay, the medical bills have become overwhelming, and these need to be settled before he can finally go home.\r\n\r\nFor those who are able to extend support, please see the QR code below. Any amount, big or small, will go a long way in helping Baby Alex come home safely.\r\n\r\nThank you so much, everyone. 💛\r\n\r\nCheers,\r\nRSS Internal Team', 'Donation Drive: Help Baby Alexander Come Home', 'Admin', '2026-04-29 09:19:12', '[{\"original\":\"QR Code.png\",\"stored\":\"uploads\\/file_69f15c903829c0.96273317.png\"}]', 0),
(214, 'Hi Team,\r\n\r\nPlease be advised that effective May 2, 2026, the validity period of all approved Letters of Authorization (LOAs) will be set to three (3) days.\r\n\r\nAttached is the memo we received from Cocolife for your reference.\r\n\r\nThank you!\r\n\r\nCheers,\r\nHR Department', 'HR Advisory: LOA Validity', 'Admin', '2026-04-29 18:58:25', '[{\"original\":\"COCOLIFE HEALTHCARE MEMO(LOA Validity Period).pdf\",\"stored\":\"uploads\\/file_69f1e451e77b29.53090560.pdf\"}]', 0),
(215, 'Hi Everyone,\r\n\r\nPlease be informed that the draft payslip for the May 5 cutoff will be released tonight. We have until tomorrow at 10 AM to review it.\r\n\r\nAny disputes due to late filings will be processed in the next cutoff. This strict deadline is implemented due to the limited working days of our payroll processor next week, to ensure payroll is processed before their holidays.\r\n\r\nThank you!\r\n\r\nCheers,\r\nHR Department', 'HR Advisory: Payroll Cut-off', 'Admin', '2026-04-30 16:15:59', NULL, 0),
(216, 'Hi Team,\r\n\r\nMay 7, 2026 has been declared a special non-working holiday in Pampanga. A notification has already been sent to your client. \r\n\r\nPlease see the applicable guidelines below:\r\n - Team members who report to work on this date will be entitled to an additional 30% holiday premium pay.\r\n- If you choose not to work, the day will follow a “no work, no pay” policy, unless you have available leave credits or if the client has approved it as a paid holiday off.\r\n\r\nPlease ensure to secure approval from your client if you will work or if it will be a paid holiday off. Kindly note that if you work without prior approval from the client, we won’t be able to apply the 30% premium pay.\r\n\r\nFor your strict compliance. Thank you!\r\n\r\nRegards,\r\nHR Department', 'HR Advisory: May 7, 2026 (Special Non-working Holiday)', 'Admin', '2026-05-05 10:47:49', NULL, 0);
