(16, 68, 'lwop', '2025-08-11', '2025-08-11', 'Noting it here: This does not fall under any of the listed leave types, so I have opted for leave without pay.\r\n\r\nI had to visit the bank and thought it closed at 4:30 PM. After checking online, I saw it actually closes at 4:00 PM, so I left early to make it in time. Thank you :)', 'rejected', '2025-08-18 04:35:48', '2025-08-18 04:35:48', 'lr_68a2ada42ca7d.png', 0, 'Hi, Ms. Christine! This will be filed as an undertime instead of LWOP.'),
